#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Build the verified BOTSD v1.3 maintenance components from exact public v1.2 files.

Duel Masters: Birth of the Super Dragon (SLPM-65882)

v1.3 contains the post-v1.2 fixes confirmed during runtime QA:
- Aura Pegasus embedded master-name boundary / NUL fix.
- Software-keyboard default mode 6 -> 9 so Latin input is half-width.
- Three stale SCRPACK probability-branch destinations relocated to translated command boundaries.
- One confirmed story-dialogue word-wrap repair.
- CHANGE/TURN transition texture restored to the retail two-row geometry.
- Deck Builder one-card `切` badge localized as `ACE`.

This tool intentionally starts from the exact public v1.2 component bytes. The two
packed visual archives use compressed XOR deltas so the output is byte-for-byte the
runtime-tested/reviewed packed asset, without embedding the original game file.

No original game assets are distributed by this script.
"""
